# © Mayanktaker Computers & Web Development | https://mayanktaker.com
# MT Nord Day global colour scheme — the light counterpart of MT Nord Night,
# a canonical Nord (Polar Night, Snow Storm, Frost, Aurora) palette derived from
# Breeze (KDE Breeze, plasma-breeze-common 6.8.2).
# Foregrounds are deepened where the canonical Nord tone fell under the 4.66:1
# text floor on this scheme's own surfaces; the final measured ratios are
# recorded in validation.md.
# Keep this file and themes/mt-nord-day/colors in sync.
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Andrew Lake <jamboarder@gmail.com>
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Marco Martin <notmart@gmail.com>
